NOTE ON THE AFTER EFFECTS SDK

This licence covers the pieFX source in this repository and nothing else.

pieFX builds against the Adobe After Effects SDK, which is licensed separately
by Adobe under its own terms. No SDK headers, libraries, or sample sources are
included in this repository or redistributed under this licence, and none may
be added under it. Building pieFX requires your own copy of the SDK, obtained
from Adobe; see the "Building" section of README.md.
